<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 68.21 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 68.21 mln rand S.African bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 68.21 million rands worth of South African bonds on Monday after selling 10.37 million on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
